      8 mutual friends
          CONFIRM             DELETE" android:gravity="center_vertical"/>
            <TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="92dp" android:text="BA   Bilal Ahmed
      14 mutual friends
          CONFIRM             DELETE" android:gravity="center_vertical"/>
            <TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="92dp" android:text="NF   Noor Fatima
      3 mutual friends
          CONFIRM             DELETE" android:gravity="center_vertical"/>
            <TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="92dp" android:text="DS   Daniyal Shafi
